              "eligibility.program.title": "Missouri Child Care Subsidy application guidance",
              "eligibility.program.description": "Compares only the page-supported child age-through-13 clause, a listed qualifying activity, and whether child care is needed for that activity. Special-needs and protective-services exceptions, income, local availability, and other case-specific conditions remain unresolved.",
              "eligibility.program.criteria": [
